{"id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","title":"Normed Space","display":"df-normed-space — Normed Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-normed-space","aliases":["58-df-normed-space","Normed Space","58-df-zfc-func-normed-space"],"display":"df-normed-space — Normed Space","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-normed-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-normed-space</span><span>Normed Space</span><span>58-df-zfc-func-normed-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normed-space — Normed Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V\">\\(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{(-)},+_{(-)},\\cdot_{(-)},\\|\\cdot\\|_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(K_{(-)},+_{(-)},\\cdot_{(-)},\\|\\cdot\\|_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> 为固定的背景类函数；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 包含这四个参数。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\operatorname{dom}(K_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(+_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\cdot_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\|\\cdot\\|_{(-)})\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\operatorname{dom}(K_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(+_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\cdot_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\|\\cdot\\|_{(-)})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormedSpace}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{NormedSpace}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(X,+,\\cdot)\\land\\|\\cdot\\|:X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\exists 0_X\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\\forall z\\in X\\;(+(\\langle0_X,z\\rangle)=z=+(\\langle z,0_X\\rangle))\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in K\\;\\left((\\|x\\|=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_X)\\land\\|\\alpha\\cdot x\\|=|\\alpha|\\|x\\|\\land\\|x+y\\|\\leq\\|x\\|+\\|y\\|\\right)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(X,+,\\cdot)\\land\\|\\cdot\\|:X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\exists 0_X\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\\forall z\\in X\\;(+(\\langle0_X,z\\rangle)=z=+(\\langle z,0_X\\rangle))\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in K\\;\\left((\\|x\\|=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_X)\\land\\|\\alpha\\cdot x\\|=|\\alpha|\\|x\\|\\land\\|x+y\\|\\leq\\|x\\|+\\|y\\|\\right)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\operatorname{NormedSpace}(X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\operatorname{NormedSpace}(X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in\\mathcal D\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in\\mathcal D\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Normed space: vector space with norm; metric from norm is translation invariant</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-func-normed-space</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>The unary form refers to the field, operations, and norm designated by the space object; it is not an assertion that some unrelated normed structure merely exists on the carrier.</li>\n<li>The induced metric is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x,y)=\\|x-y\\|\">\\(d(x,y)=\\|x-y\\|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Banach: complete normed; fundamental for functional analysis</li>\n<li>Over the scalar field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>, the continuous dual consists of bounded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-linear maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to K\">\\(X\\to K\\)</span> and carries the usual operator norm.</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell^p\">\\(\\ell^p\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> are Banach for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq p\\leq\\infty\">\\(1\\leq p\\leq\\infty\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(K)\">\\(C(K)\\)</span> is Banach in the supremum norm when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> is compact.</li>\n<li>Reflexive: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V \\cong V^{**}\">\\(V \\cong V^{**}\\)</span> via double dual; Hilbert spaces are reflexive</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"K_{(-)},+_{(-)},\\cdot_{(-)},\\|\\cdot\\|_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\operatorname{dom}(K_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(+_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\cdot_{(-)})\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\|\\cdot\\|_{(-)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NormedSpace}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(X,+,\\cdot)\\land\\|\\cdot\\|:X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\exists 0_X\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\\forall z\\in X\\;(+(\\langle0_X,z\\rangle)=z=+(\\langle z,0_X\\rangle))\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in K\\;\\left((\\|x\\|=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_X)\\land\\|\\alpha\\cdot x\\|=|\\alpha|\\|x\\|\\land\\|x+y\\|\\leq\\|x\\|+\\|y\\|\\right)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\operatorname{NormedSpace}(X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in\\mathcal D\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)","display":true},{"tex":"d(x,y)=\\|x-y\\|","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"X\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell^p","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq p\\leq\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"C(K)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"V \\cong V^{**}","display":false}],"bytes":2497,"backlinks":[{"id":"2bd16e25117a1eaa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)$（see [[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]）"},{"id":"d5688b5ff9b1f787","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$X,X^*,\\tau_{w^*}\\in V$；沿用 [[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]] 中固定的 $K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X$，不在本谓词内重新选择它们。"},{"id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\